---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
export const prerender = true;
---

<BaseLayout title="Implementation status" locale="en" noindex>
  <section class="site-container py-16">
    <p class="eyebrow">DEVELOPMENT HANDOFF / NOT A LIVE BOOKING SERVICE</p><h1
      class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold"
    >
      MANISA implementation status
    </h1><div class="mt-8 max-w-3xl space-y-6 text-muted">
      <p>
        This first source-code milestone covers the homepage, flight search, results and flight
        details in English and draft Arabic. Actual airport, inventory, price and fare-rule data
        must come from the configured backend API.
      </p><p>
        Booking, payment, accounts, support and legal pages are not implemented yet. Their
        navigation items are deliberately unavailable. No real booking or charge can be created by
        this repository.
      </p><p>
        Design images must be exported to public/design. Missing assets are explicitly identified on
        the page; they are not replaced by unrelated stock imagery. The repository's README and
        verification report list the integration and release blockers.
      </p><p>
        A successful build, browser tests and Figma screenshot review are required before this
        milestone can be accepted for deployment.
      </p>
    </div><a class="btn btn-primary mt-10" href="/en/">Open homepage</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
